  "system": {
    "identifier": "genwa-data-release-torrent",
    "description": "<p>You outstretch your hand and launch a stream of prismatic particles of light that overwhelm creatures and their senses. All creatures in range must make a Constitution saving throw.</p>\n<p>Success: Affected creature takes half of 3d8 lightning damage and are Shocked until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Failure: Affected creature takes 3d8 lightning damage and gain 1 rank of Shocked.</p>\n<p>Critical Failure: Affected creature takes 5d8 lightning damage, gain 1 rank of Shocked and are Firewalled.</p>\n<p>Angel Link: Allied creatures, excluding yourself, in range suffer no harmful effects, and gain 1d8 temporary chakra and Signal Boosted until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>Demon Link: Allied creatures, excluding yourself, in range suffer no harmful effects, and increase the next instance of damage they deal by 1d8.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3, and the damage by 1d8. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, increase the Angel and Demon link effects by +1d8. If this jutsu is cast at S-Rank, increase the Angel and Demon link effects by +1d8.</p>\n<p>| #### Art Link / Pinterest Link |</p>",
